{"title": "Frenzied Fury", "pageid": 40131, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Frenzied_Fury", "categories": ["Class actions", "Bonus actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Buff.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Generic_Buff.webp/300px-Generic_Buff.webp, /w/images/0/02/Generic_Buff.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Generic_Buff.webp/300px-Generic_Buff.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Generic_Buff.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Frenzied Fury</b> is an action that allows <a href=\"/wiki/Flind\" title=\"Flind\">Flind</a> to go into a frenzy, gaining the ability to make powerful multiattacks. This action is only available after her <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Seething_Fury_(Condition)\" title=\"Seething Fury (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Seething_Fury_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Seething_Fury_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Seething_Fury_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Seething_Fury_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Seething_Fury_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Seething_Fury_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Seething Fury\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Seething_Fury_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Seething_Fury_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2e/Seething_Fury_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Seething_Fury_(Condition)\" title=\"Seething Fury (Condition)\">Seething Fury</a> has grown into a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Festering_Frenzy_(Condition)\" title=\"Festering Frenzy (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Seething_Fury_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Seething_Fury_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Seething_Fury_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Seething_Fury_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Seething_Fury_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Seething_Fury_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Festering Frenzy\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Seething_Fury_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Seething_Fury_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2e/Seething_Fury_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Festering_Frenzy_(Condition)\" title=\"Festering Frenzy (Condition)\">Festering Frenzy</a> over the course of 3 turns.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nFilled with a furious anger, the gnoll can attack multiple times on its turn.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/42px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: Self\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: Self</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Per combat\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: Per combat</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/I